        <activityName xml:lang="en">Catalytic converter, SCR, 200 litre</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Catalytic converter, SCR, 200 litre
na;
Synonyms: Selective Catalytic Reduction, SCR; 
UUID: f8226e1b-06f6-3397-b246-3455e49c7f20
The module includes the most important materials used for production of the SCR (Selective Catalytic Reduction) catalytic converter. It includes also the transport of these materials and the energy and water needed for production.
Location: undefined
Technology: Average technology.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f8226e1b-06f6-3397-b246-3455e49c7f20.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
